6. CONCLUSIONS\
PTA-RB is not merely a performance update; it is the next evolutionary step in EV energy management. By moving from reactive control to predictive physics modeling, Tesla can solidify its position as the manufacturer of the most energy-efficient cars on the market without expensive hardware modifications.\
